Comment: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:32.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,From Sumomo to Tsuwabuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:02.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:05.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:07.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:12.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Like you, Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.73,0:00:35.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:38.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A-Akihime!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:45.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:23.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1} I may have done something irreversible.{I may have done something that cannot be undone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:33.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey Yayoi-san! It's been on my mind since summer camp, but... {HA- Hey, hey Yayoi-san! It's been on my mind since summer camp, but...}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.49,0:03:34.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, what? {HA- What is it, what?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:36.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The person Sumomo-chan likes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:38.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan? {check}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It might be Kisaragi-sensei.    {can I put sensei here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:48.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Usually, Sumomo-chan is shy.{Because usually Sumomo-chan is shy.} {HA- You see, Sumomo-chan is usually shy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:53.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But if you look, in front of Sensei she is smiling brightly. {HA- But look, In front of sensei, she is smiling brightly.} {... her face brightens up...?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.97,0:03:57.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I was just thinking the same thing.{I thought of the same thing} {thought} {HA- I thought the same thing.} {I was just thinking that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:04:00.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see, so she's in love. {I see, so she's in love.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:02.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi-sensei is fun to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:05.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And he has that manly characteristic about him. {is there any other ways to say adult male like characteristics・ {HA- And he acts manly (?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:07.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,His legs are long too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:09.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, about three times longer than Tsuwabuki's. {HA- Tsuwabuki's.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:10.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:11.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.82,0:04:19.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I think the best match for Sumomo-chan is someone who has been with us for a while.{I think that the person that fits for Sumomo-chan is someone that has been with us for awhile.}{HA- I think the one Sumomo likes is someone whose been with us for a while.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:20.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.09,0:04:29.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:34.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And for that reason, today we're going to have a meeting to talk about it.{Today because of that reason, open a meeting!/have a conference!} {HA- Today, bring it up and we'll have a meeting to talk about it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:36.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?! {HA- What are you talking about?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:37.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:38.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:38.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:39.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:40.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The meeting. {HA- The meeting.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:48.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Alright! Two bowls of seconds of Mitsumame. Here you go!{Here~ Two bowls of seconds for Mitsumame, here you go.} {HA- here you go.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I've been waiting for this!{I waited so long!/I waited for this!/}{HA- I've been waiting for this!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:51.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This, this! {HA- This, this!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:56.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey hey hey, so what's this meeting about?{Hey hey hey, So what are we going to talking about?} {HA- Hey, hey, hey... So what's this meeting about?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:05:00.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ahem... the best match for Akihime-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:03.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The best match for Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:05.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So you're saying that it's not Kisaragi-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:06.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:17.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Your face is red, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:19.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why did Tsuwabuki's face turn red? {HA- Why did Tsuwabuki's face turn red?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, now why is that I wonder? {HA- Hmm... I wonder why...?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:28.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is it possible?! Could it be?! You like Sumomo-chan!{Possibly?! Maybe?! You like Sumomo-chan!}{HA- *big ecstatic smile*}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:31.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Then does that mean you've already confessed? {HA- Does this mean you've already confessed?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Did you kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:34.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Kiss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:36.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:38.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Where? I wonder how many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.89,0:05:39.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Guys...{HA- Guys...}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:41.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Alright! For now, let's all just...{Alright! Right now right here let's- }{HA- Alright! For now, Let's all just...}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:42.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now now, please calm down.{Calm down clam down.}{HA- Calm down, calm down.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How can I possibly be calm right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:47.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Our Tsuwabuki and Sumomo-chan are going to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:49.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Lovey lovey.{Love love/In love love/In love.}{HA- Love love/Oh, I don't know how to word it right.}{Lovey Dovey}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:51.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's why I said it's not like that! {HA- ...That's why I said it's not like that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:56.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I think that Akihime only thinks of me as a friend.{I think that Akihime look at/think of/view me just as a friend.} {HA- I think Akihime wants to be just friends.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:58.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean saying weak things like that?!{What are you going to do saying weak things like that!}{HA- Look at you, saying weak things like that!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's all about guts, guts!{GUTS, GUTS!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:02.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, there is a very good chance, even for Haru.{That's right, there is plenty of chance even to Haru.}{HA- Here, now... There are plenty of chances, even for Haru.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:07.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, everyone let's cheer for Tsuwabuki-kun and Sumomo-chan. {is there any other ways to put it so you don稚 use 典hat痴 right・twice?}{Alright everyone, let's cheer Tsuwabuki-kun and Sumomo-chan on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:09.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:10.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:14.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,As our store's special guest I'll give this to you as a present.{As our store's special guest I'll present it to you/give it to you as a present.}{HA- As our store's special guest, I'll give it to you as a present.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:20.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru isn't very good at talking, so...{Haru is not good at talking so./Talking is not Haru's forte so.}{HA- Haru isn't good at talking, so...}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"I like you," or...{I like you・or} {HA- "I Like You", or...}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"Please marry me,"{HA- "Please Marry Me."}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:24.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,are things he can't say.{Are something you can't say.}{HA- are things he can't say.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:25.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-?! {he meant to say 杜arry?媒 {HA- Marry?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,In those situations, just use a cell phone.{In those situations, using the cellphone.}{HA- If you're using a cell phone,}{In those situations, just use a cellphone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:30.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Text messaging is a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:33.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Use emoticons, as they're also convenient. {HA- Use emoticons,}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Stop stalling and do it already!{Stop fidgeting/hesitating and do it!/get it done!/get it over with!}{she said make a contract if translated literary, but I don稚 think that痴 what she means}{HA- Stop hesitating and let's get this over with!} {HA- She's saying Stop taking so long and let's finish this. Finish = Complete the "contract"}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:39.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:41.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We're with you on this.{We will help you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:43.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don't lose to Kisaragi-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:51.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Guys, you know...{Guys・You know・You guys・}{HA- You know...}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:56.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you keep waiting, someone will take her away from you.{If you keep hesitating/waiting someone's going to take her away.}{HA- If you keep waiting, someone will take her from you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you're looking for Tsuwabuki, he went home already.{If it is Tsuwabuki you are looking for, he went home already./Tsuwabuki went home already.}{HA- If you're looking for Tsuwabuki, he went home already.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:13.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like he went to Limelight with everyone. {check on the store name}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:19.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Limelight is Flora-chan's store, right?{Limelight is・Flora's store, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.87,0:07:28.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, looks like something good happened between you and Tsuwabuki-kun.{Sumomo, looks like something good happened to you with Tsuwabuki-kun.}{HA- Sumomo, looks like something good happened between you and Tsuwabuki-kun,}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:35.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Today, Sumomo looks different than usual.{Today's Sumomo, looked different from before/usual.}{HA- Today, Sumomo looks differant than usual.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:40.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I've watched Sumomo since I was little. {HA- I've watched Sumomo since I was little.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.05,0:07:44.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,During our elementary school years, when you could finally swing on the bar...{check} {HA- Back in elementary school, when you could finally swing on the bar...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:48.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It made me happy to see Sumomo so full of joy.{It brought me happiness to see Sumomo so happy.}{HA- It made me so happy to see Sumomo full of joy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's calming.{It's relieving.}{check} {HA- It's... calming...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:57.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Today, I'm very happy like I was back then. {HA- Today I'm happy, like back then.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.16,0:08:09.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That was...{That is./That was.}{HA- That is...}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:21.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A technique that I, the best in Saint Aspalas, have never seen before.{A technique/spell/skill that I, the best in Cent Asparas have not seen before.}{HA- A spell that I, the best Cent Asparas, have not seen before.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:24.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Matsuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:26.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Miss!{Yes, my lady(This is Aiko's Tl please check)}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:28.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:33.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, my breath was taken away just like you, Miss. {HA-... just like you, Miss.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.95,0:08:38.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was more wonderful than anything I've ever dreamed of.{It was a wonderful view/sight that I have not even seen in dreams.}{HA- It was more wonderful than anything I've ever dreamed of.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Miss? {HA- Right, Miss?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:49.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please gather 1000 years worth of Figurare's data right now. {HA- Gather 1000 years worth of Figurare's data, right now.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:55.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The lake froze in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,With a technique as strong as that...{Such powerful/strong spell/technique as that, }{HA- A spell as strong as that,}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:00.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There should be a clue somewhere. {HA- There should be a clue around here somewhere.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.97,0:09:06.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing, even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.36,0:09:08.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong, next! {HA- Wrong! Next!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:12.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Next! Next! Next! Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Next! {poor Matsuda, he kind of reminds me of Matsuda from death note lol}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:25.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's it! {HA- There it is!/That's it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:32.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Moterios Oludin Radium.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:36.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A powerful technique that decreases the temperature in the surroundings instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:38.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There is no mistake, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:42.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,In the long history of Figurare, {HA- In the long history of Figurare,}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:46.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,only a few prodigies were able to use this technique.{GF - Original: The ones who used this technique were only a few prodigies.}{HA- The few who used these spells were prodigies.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:53.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,At least for the past hundred years, only one has used this technique. {HA- For at least the past hundred years, only one has used this spell.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:55.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And that person is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:03.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Karin-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:05.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Karin-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:09.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The one who Miss has admired since her childhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.69,0:10:15.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The legendary Stellar Spinear, the girl genius who broke all the records of Figurare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:20.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eighteen years ago, Karin-sama went to Retroscena. {HA- Eighteen years ago, Karin-sama went to Retorushena.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:25.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No one doubted that she would win the race of collecting the star drops.{No one doubted that she wasn't going to lose the race of collecting drops.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:28.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But Karin-sama never returned to Figurare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:30.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Never again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:36.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I ended up agreeing to this.{I ended up making the contract.}{This is the literal translation・I don稚 know what he really means figuratively, so please check} {HA- Is it like, *Sigh*... I ended up having to decide what you should do.?}
