Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:47.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give Sumomo-chan Tsuwabuki's number too. {HA- Then, I'll give Sumomo-chan Tsuwabuki's number.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:50.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How about you send her a greeting text message first?{First why don't you send her a greeting text message?} {HA- How about you send her a greeting text message first?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:52.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.{Worry free/Lightly.}{HA- (Guilt/Stress/Worry)-Free.}{Don't worry.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:53.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:58.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I've never thought about messaging...{Not such thing as mails.}{thought start} {HA- I never thought about messaging,}{I've never thought about messaging before...}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:01.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But still, I want to talk face to face.{But I still want to talk face to face. (?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:04.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}My honest feelings.{My true feelings.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:25.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There's no way that she'd still be here.{There is no way that she's here.}{There's no way she'll be there, though.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:29.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What am I expecting?{thought end}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei... {HA- Sensei.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:02.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You know, Sumomo-chan...{Look here/There there now Sumomo-chan.}{HA- You know, Sumomo-chan.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:06.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We're the only ones here, and there's no one else around. {HA- We're the only ones here, no one else is around.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:08.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So you don't need to call me Sensei. {HA- Therefore, you don't need to call me sensei.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:15.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, a picture of them together.{Wow, a picture of them together. (?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:19.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, did you print two of them on purpose?{SENSEI}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.74,0:12:22.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, it's not Sensei. {HA- I told you, it's not sensei.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:27.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was embarrassing in front of everyone, so calling you Sensei became a habit. {HA- so calling you sensei}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:32.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's about time we told them about us. {HA- It's about time we let them know about us.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:49.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? It felt like there was someone here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.19,0:12:51.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:56.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you found something important so I came to see.{I heard you found a fond object so I came to see.}{A what subject? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:57.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome, Nii-san. {HA- Onii-san (it is Onii for brother, right?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:13:00.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Here it is, Dad.{This is it dad./It's this dad.}{HA- Here it is, Dad.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:04.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this is nostalgic. {HA- Well, this is nostalgic.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:08.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Our wedding photo.{Our marriage picture./Picture during our marriage.}{HA- Our wedding photo.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:11.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Dad and Mom look wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:20.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}As I thought, the one who Akihime likes is Kisaragi-sensei.  {HA- likes?}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:31.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I don't want to see anyone tonight. {thought} {Emo-Tsuwabuki lol} {HA- I don't want to see anyone tonight.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:34.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Also, it's a new moon.{Also, the moon is cresent.}{thought} {check}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.53,0:13:36.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I can remain in my human form.{I can stay as a human./I can stay in my human form.} {HA- I'll stay as my human form.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:39.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I don't need to go to Akihime. {check}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:52.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Dad and Mom married out of love, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:56.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Karin-san... your mother, you heard it from her?{GF - Original: Your mother, Karin-san... you heard it from her?}{Karin-san... did you hear it from your mother?}{HA- did you hear that from your mother?}{Aiko: Karin....You mother, you heard if from her?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:09.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Once every hundred years.{HA- Once every hundred years.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:13.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The technique that only Karin-sama was able to use. And on her first try. {HA- The spell only Karin-sama (could?) use(d). On the first try.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:16.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But that girl... How? {HA- That girl? How?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:30.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nee-san sure is pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:37.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.05,0:14:41.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Although I couldn't say it in front of Nee-san. {HA- eh... Are we gonna keep it as sister or change it to Onee-san...}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:47.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:49.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:55.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:58.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This bride is Karin-sama... {Again, what? "The bride is..." -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:03.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The one called the legendary Stellar Spinear, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:04.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:07.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And this person is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:16.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can still remember that event eighteen years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.11,0:15:23.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That was a night of miracles no one had ever seen. {HA- had ever seen before.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:29.37,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puru Radi Ecresiang{Purub*Radi*Ekresiang} {check}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.55,0:15:35.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,With one spell, Nee-san... {HA- With one spell, Onee-san...}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:39.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,gathered six star drops in a blink of an eye. {HA- Gathered all six star drops in the blink of an eye.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:41.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:47.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And then, it was when she was about to gather the seventh star drop. {HA- But then, just as she was about to gather the seventh star drop,}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:16:01.25,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Gaterius Oludin Radium {check}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:12.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Both of them fell in love at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:20.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Back then humans from Retroscena and humans from Figurare were forbidden to marry each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:29.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Onee-sama threw away her title of genius Stellar Spinear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:32.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,To be in the arms of just one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.39,0:16:42.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That is Akihime Seishiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:46.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sumomo-chan is the daughter of those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:50.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But by regulations, the whole issue was kept a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:56.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sumomo-chan still doesn't know that her mother was a person from Figurare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:05.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan, I wonder if I ever told you this...{I wonder if I ever told Sumomo-chan this.} {For lack of a better sentence. I'm sure there's one out there, but I can't think of it. -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:12.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The first time when I told Karin-san my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:14.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Your feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:24.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,My heart was beating so fast, that it felt like it was going to stop. {HA- My heart was beating so fast, it felt like it was going to stop.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:30.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"Am I really the right person for Karin-san?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.55,0:17:34.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"Am I causing trouble for Karin-san?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:36.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.53,0:17:42.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Mom was not troubled, because to Mom, Dad was...{check}{because to mom?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:46.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When you get to really like someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:49.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,you get so nervous you can't endure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:53.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Waiting for Karin-san's answer felt so long. {HA- Waiting for Karin-san's answer felt so long...}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:55.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It felt like a million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:18:00.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But in truth it was only ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:06.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Karin-san answered me right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.76,0:18:12.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I love you too.{I love you too./I like you too.}{HA- BIIIIG Difference :P but probobly I love you too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:24.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.19,0:18:29.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I have to go back to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:31.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There is something important I have to do!{There is something important we need to talk about! (?) CHECK}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.55,0:18:44.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Come to think of it, it's been a while since I looked at the night sky alone.{Now that you look at it, it's been awhile since I looked at the night sky alone.}{thought start} {HA- Come to think of it, it's been a while since I looked at the night sky alone.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:52.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I've finally realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:19:02.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No matter who Akihime likes, I like Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:09.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Since when did I, about Akihime...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:15.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}After becoming Yuki-chan it seemed as though I knew a lot about Akihime. {HA- After I became Yuki-chan, it seemed as if I knew alot about Akihime.}{it seemed as if I knew more...?}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:17.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But it may be that I still don't know anything. {HA- still know nothing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:22.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime...{thought end}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:32.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I have something important I want to tell you. {HA- I have something important to tell you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:35.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll wait at the secret place...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This was two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:08.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pretend Yuki-chan is here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:13.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Then I can have more courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:19.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get it across, just like Mom. My true feelings, surely...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:33.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun, I'm sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:38.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was too nerve-racking. It felt like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.95,0:20:42.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I ran away because I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:46.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I would wake up from the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:53.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was as if I wasn't the girl that Tsuwabuki-kun was thinking of.{If I was not the girl Tsuwabuki-kun thought of.}{HA- As if...(?) (not sarcasm)}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:58.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not good at talking and I'm uninteresting, so I might disappoint you.{I'm not good at talking and uninteresting so I might disappoint you.}{HA- I'm not good at talking (and what?), so I might disappoint you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:02.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,To think like that caused me a lot of pain.{To think like that, I was in pain.} {HA- To think like that, caused me great pain.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.97,0:21:06.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This choked up feeling in my chest was painful.{The feeling of my chest blocking up was painful}{is there a better way to say this?} {HA- Don't know what she's trying to say}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:08.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:10.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I feel the same way.{It's the same for me too.} {HA- I feel the same way.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.29,0:21:22.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.20,0:21:29.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,never knew that liking someone would be this painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.07,0:21:40.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I like you. {HA- Ok seriously, is it they like each other, or they love eachother, OR is it the same word in japan?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:44.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There's nothing else I can say.{I can't say anything else.}{thought start}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.39,0:21:49.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I can feel that Akihime is here, but the words won't come out. {now this would be 的 can feel Akihime,・that that is just awkward} {HA- I see that Akihime is here, but the words won't come out.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:52.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I stand in front of Akihime. {thought end}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.47,0:22:04.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.86,0:22:09.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun... I like you.{I llikeTsuwabuki-kun}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.62,0:22:24.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:27.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's the stray acorn. {is that the right seed?} {yep.}{RANDOM ACORN GET}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:29.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Stray? {HA- Stray?}{Stray?}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:36.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's plant this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.13,0:24:21.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.67,0:24:22.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.09,0:24:22.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,At last!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.70,0:24:23.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Should I summarize and tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.74,0:24:25.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A couple is born! {HA- Now this just sounds wierd :P}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.34,0:24:27.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm jealous, it's their first date!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.89,0:24:30.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,They probably can't hear our voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.09,0:24:31.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sweet...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.26,0:24:32.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Those two's world...{World of those two.} {HA- Those two's world...}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:34.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It might not work out that well.
